{"seq":2,"slug":"refactoring-with-type-safety","title":"类型安全的重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-typescript-project/typescript-in-the-ai-workflow/refactoring-with-type-safety","wordCount":2163,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型安全的重构\">类型安全的重构</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>重构——在不改变行为的前提下改善代码结构——是 agent 参与度最高的工程活动之一，也是风险最集中的一种：改一处、牵十处，漏一处就是线上事故。TypeScript 把这个风险问题转化成一个搜索问题：类型一变，所有失配的调用点由编译器枚举成错误清单，agent 逐条修复直到清单清空。大范围改动从「靠记忆和运气」变成「靠编译器导航」，这是 agent 敢于跨几十个文件做重构的全部前提。本节拆开看：编译器如何让改动可追踪、agent 的重构循环长什么样、以及要把这套能力用满需要哪些前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把重构风险转化成搜索问题\">核心概念：把重构风险转化成搜索问题</h2><p>类型安全重构的核心机制，是把「改一处、牵十处」的风险问题转化成一个有确定终点的搜索问题。它建立在三个可分别检验的性质上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可枚举</strong>：给类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 改签名后，全部失配站点由 <code>tsc</code> 作为独立报错逐条列出，总工作量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从开放问题变成封闭清单。</li>\n<li><strong>有停机判据</strong>：完成条件不是「看起来差不多了」，而是 <code>tsc --noEmit</code> 零错误——一个机器判定、无歧义的终点。</li>\n<li><strong>覆盖率可度量</strong>：设 any 化比率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，编译器实际能看见的失配只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)\\sum_i c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项——any 率直接决定重构护栏的覆盖面，藏在 any 后面的引用站点不报错、静默地拿着旧形状继续跑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"类型让重构可追踪\">类型让重构可追踪</h2><p>给一个类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 改签名后，设它的引用站点为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_1, s_2, \\dots, s_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、各站点的修复代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则这次重构的总工作量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{k} c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2887em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——关键在于这个和式是<strong>可枚举的</strong>：<code>tsc</code> 会把每一项作为独立报错列出来。没有类型时，同样的改动退化成在全库文本搜索变量名并祈祷没有动态访问；有了类型，「哪些地方要跟着改」从开放问题变成封闭清单。</p>\n<p>这份清单还自带收敛信号。重构完成的判据不是「看起来差不多了」，而是 <code>tsc --noEmit</code> 零错误——一个机器判定、无歧义的终点。配合 <a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/release-notes/typescript-5-6.html\">TypeScript 5.6</a> 的 region-prioritized diagnostics（编辑器优先报告靠近正在编辑区域的诊断），agent 在大批报错中总能先拿到与自己当前改动最相关的反馈，循环的每次迭代都有的放矢。</p>\n<p>但有一个盲区必须点破：<strong>any 是重构盲区，不只是代码坏味道</strong>。设代码库中 any 化比率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，编译器实际能看见的失配只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)\\sum_{i=1}^{k} c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2887em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项——藏在 any 后面的引用站点不报错、静默地拿着旧形状继续跑。所以「严类型是安全重构的前提」不是风格偏好，而是覆盖率陈述：any 率直接决定重构护栏的覆盖面。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重构操作</th>\n<th>类型护航机制</th>\n<th>典型反模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重命名字段/类型</td>\n<td>LSP rename 由 type checker 驱动全库改写</td>\n<td>手动查找替换，漏掉重导出与字符串键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改函数签名</td>\n<td>全部调用点编译报错成清单</td>\n<td>给参数偷偷改成可选 + 默认值，把迁移债藏进签名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判别联合新增变体</td>\n<td><code>never</code> 穷尽检查暴露所有未处理分支</td>\n<td>用 <code>else</code> 分支吞掉新变体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替换数据结构</td>\n<td><code>satisfies</code> 在新结构定义处就地校验</td>\n<td><code>as</code> 断言静音差异，把崩溃推迟到运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动模块</td>\n<td>project references 与路径别名统一解析</td>\n<td>相对路径硬编码，挪一次断一片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>穷尽检查值得单独说一句：对判别联合做 <code>switch</code> 时以 <code>never</code> 类型收尾，新增一个变体的瞬间，所有漏处理的分支全部编译报错。「加一个字段，编译器替你找出所有该改的地方」——这正是本节开头那句话的最小可见版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"agent-借类型安全重构\">agent 借类型安全重构</h2><p>agent 的重构循环是一个由编译器误差驱动的控制回路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as Agent&#10;    participant T as tsc --noEmit&#10;    participant U as 测试套件&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;T: 提交核心类型变更&#10;    T--&gt;&gt;A: 返回失配站点清单&#10;    loop 直到零错误&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;A: 逐条修复调用点&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;T: 全量复查&#10;    end&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;U: 行为回归测试&#10;    U--&gt;&gt;A: 通过即完成\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as Agent\n    participant T as tsc --noEmit\n    participant U as 测试套件\n    A-&gt;&gt;T: 提交核心类型变更\n    T--&gt;&gt;A: 返回失配站点清单\n    loop 直到零错误\n        A-&gt;&gt;A: 逐条修复调用点\n        A-&gt;&gt;T: 全量复查\n    end\n    A-&gt;&gt;U: 行为回归测试\n    U--&gt;&gt;A: 通过即完成</pre><p>这个回路的每一步都是机械操作：读错误、定位、修、再查。机械恰恰是 agent 的强项——重命名、抽取函数、内联变量、改签名这类有类型护航的重构，agent 做得比多数人快且不漏；人类的价值集中在回路之外的部分：决定往哪个方向重构、哪个抽象值得留。</p>\n<p>回路能转多快，取决于全量类型检查的成本。<a href=\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/typescript-native-port/\">2025 年 3 月微软公告的 TypeScript 原生移植</a>（Anders Hejlsberg 撰文）给出的目标是<strong>多数构建提速 10 倍</strong>、显著降低内存占用；<a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/typescript-go\">typescript-go 仓库</a>已确认原生移植完成，TS 7.0 RC 起命令名回归 <code>tsc</code>，其状态表标注 type checking 已 done 且与 TS 6.0 报错一致。对重构的实际意义：整程序重查从分钟级进入秒级，agent 可以在<strong>每一次 edit 之后</strong>跑全量检查，而不必依赖增量近似或攒一批改动再验——反馈周期越短，回路越不容易跑偏。</p>\n<p>另一层安全网来自测试。类型保证接口契约不变，测试保证运行时行为不变，二者覆盖的重构风险不相交：「形状没变但逻辑错了」只有测试抓得住，「契约变了」只有编译器抓得住。重构后的固定动作因此是两连跑：先 <code>tsc --noEmit</code> 再测试套件，顺序不能反——先用最便宜的检查过滤掉结构性错误，再花贵的算力验证行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把这种能力用到极致\">把这种能力用到极致</h2><p>第一是把类型调到最严。<a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig/#strict\">strict</a> 及其家族（<code>noUncheckedIndexedAccess</code>、<code>exactOptionalPropertyTypes</code> 等）决定了清单的完整度；TypeScript 6.0 起 strict 已默认开启，松散配置反而成了需要显式声明的例外。</p>\n<p>第二是小步提交。一次改动引入的错误越多，报错之间的因果越难分离——修复 A 可能让 B 的报错消失也可能让它显形，批量修复时 agent 容易被中间态误导。小步的本质是保持「每轮报错都可归因于本轮改动」。一个大重构的标准拆法是三段式：<strong>扩宽 → 迁移 → 收窄</strong>。先把目标类型放宽成新旧形态的联合，让两类调用方共存编译；逐个文件迁移；最后删除旧分支、收紧联合——每一步都保持零错误，任何时刻中断仓库都处于可用状态。</p>\n<p>第三是升级前先清配置债。<a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/release-notes/typescript-6-0.html\">TypeScript 6.0</a> 作为面向 TS 7.0 的过渡版本废弃了一批旧选项（如 <code>--moduleResolution node10</code>），官方明确 <strong>7.0 不再支持这些废弃项</strong>，6.0 里只能靠 <code>&quot;ignoreDeprecations&quot;: &quot;6.0&quot;</code> 暂时压住。计划大规模重构的项目应先把这批选项迁干净，否则工具链升级本身就会打断重构节奏。若目标是 Node.js 原生直跑 TS，还应提前开 <code>--erasableSyntaxOnly</code> 把 enum / parameter properties 等非可剥离语法重构掉——这是典型的「趁重构顺手还债」。</p>\n<p>反模式同样明确：长期存活的「大爆炸」重构分支（偏离主干越远，合并时的失配爆炸越大）；<code>as unknown as T</code> 双跳断言（等于当着编译器的面伪造事实）；以及为了过编译把参数改成可选——签名上的每个可选参数都是对未来调用方的免责声明，债务只是换了记账科目。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>本地与 CI 统一 <code>npx tsc --noEmit</code>，重构分支上每个 commit 保持零错误。</li>\n<li>大重构按「扩宽 → 迁移 → 收窄」排 commit，任何一步都可独立合入。</li>\n<li>重构 diff 中出现 <code>as</code> 即打回；确需豁免用 <code>@ts-expect-error</code> 并注明 issue（无错时它自己会报错）。</li>\n<li>升级 TS 大版本前先跑一遍 deprecated options 清单，别让工具链迁移撞车业务重构。</li>\n<li>rename / extract / inline / 改签名整批交给 agent；拆模块、换抽象由人定方案后再派发。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>类型安全的重构 = 可枚举的失配清单 + 零错误的收敛判据 + 测试兜住行为。any 率决定护栏覆盖面，小步保证每轮报错可归因；原生编译器把全量检查压进秒级后，这条回路已经快到可以挂在每一次编辑后面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"types-as-lightweight-spec\">类型作为轻量规格</a> —— 重构的起点是规格：先有类型契约，才谈得上安全地改实现。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../why-typescript-helps-agents/tsc-as-fast-feedback\">tsc 作为快速反馈回路</a> —— 重构循环的速度上限由这条回路的延迟决定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型安全的重构","id":"类型安全的重构"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把重构风险转化成搜索问题","id":"核心概念-把重构风险转化成搜索问题"},{"level":2,"text":"类型让重构可追踪","id":"类型让重构可追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"agent 借类型安全重构","id":"agent-借类型安全重构"},{"level":2,"text":"把这种能力用到极致","id":"把这种能力用到极致"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"类型作为轻量规格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-typescript-project/typescript-in-the-ai-workflow/types-as-lightweight-spec"},"next":{"title":"保持类型健康","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-typescript-project/typescript-in-the-ai-workflow/keeping-types-healthy"}}